<Positioned left="72" top="1266" width="1056" height="38">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#4F46E5" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="BOLD" width="1056"><Raw><![CDATA[记住这三点]]></Raw></Text>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="1312" width="1056" height="44">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="NORMAL" width="1056"><Raw><![CDATA[1. 有界不等于固定：外层给最大宽高，子节点仍在约束内选择尺寸。]]></Raw></Text>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="1362" width="1056" height="44">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="NORMAL" width="1056"><Raw><![CDATA[2. Expanded 只占 Flex 主轴剩余空间；交叉轴仍需有限约束或 STRETCH。]]></Raw></Text>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="72" top="1412" width="1056" height="44">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="NORMAL" width="1056"><Raw><![CDATA[3. Stack 先布局非定位子节点，再按 left/top/right/bottom 放置定位节点。]]></Raw></Text>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1510" width="960" height="38">
